     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Hello, </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">I am trying to use Rmarkdown to make tables as I would like them and was hoping someone could help me. I am currently asking for a student who will be using MS Word, but I am also interested in this output for PDF.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">If I run the following as a RMD script, I get tables that look like Table 1 in the picture.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">---</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">title: &quot;Tables with R&quot;</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">fig_height: 6</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">fig_width: 7</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">output: word_document</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">fig_caption: yes</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">---</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```{r, results = &#39;asis&#39;, echo=FALSE}</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">dat &lt;- mtcars[1:5, 1:6]</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```{r, echo=FALSE}</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">rmarkdownTable &lt;- function(df){</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">  cat(paste(names(df), collapse = &quot;|&quot;))</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">  cat(&quot;\\n&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">  cat(paste(rep(&quot;-&quot;, ncol(df)), collapse = &quot;|&quot;))</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">  cat(&quot;\\n&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">  for(i in 1:nrow(df)){</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">    cat(paste(df[i,], collapse = &quot;|&quot;))</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">    cat(&quot;\\n&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">    }</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">invisible(NULL)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">}</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Table 1. mtcars Data<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```{r, results = &#39;asis&#39;, echo=FALSE}<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">rmarkdownTable(dat)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Table 1. mtcars Data<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```{r, results = &#39;asis&#39;, echo=FALSE}</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">knitr::kable(dat, row.names=FALSE)<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">```<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">__________________________</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">This is close to what I want, and is produced with the function defined above or with the knitr::kable() function.  </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">What I really want is for the table to look like Table 2, with the additional horizontal lines:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/6iblSRMiFJcyN5RgJnFl0xcEcui7NjvJ7vTBjjtcPD4l-15_JWhagE-Ni9B--Xlv9867hfNpeshKfzB6nD8exuO9Ni_56L2PNJ5p1MRTfOcQ0WWKjgdDgsS6Dx9xWZ8yIPKsIFgo_2U6EyIDnoC4si782xKbxIOyToI4myO8-MCfz8J4bGnRLoJv0TMP0HvT43P7MADkBe0YivXDzuF5aqymJ0A0tM0FmEBeMFLE_yW7D9rEz2tGEz58LMIE2_gcmv0q0nKD4XGTWiXmTvRZCuAaAZYuRSUllLQXZ4sV-pvwl0vT0x4dbAPSffNkUW-NgUMgj_elsJ1JpyTcSvq-mlqp4419lSnDiU6wvhS3tNxtNubuHtEd2e4SncZFPq_8T11RnotVmCro_AnFy-yJpLE_C4x-MB4uMSJwN70EQANXlFK4BHhPNT-s4Mx_H33UMDCn0SKmtjZies8=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mail.google.com/mail/u/2/?ui=2&amp;ik=01b8ab0d1e&amp;view=fimg&amp;th=15086589a54013d7&amp;attid=0.1&amp;disp=emb&amp;realattid=ii_1508655b332432d6&amp;attbid=ANGjdJ-cofTverLl_p8rnD1reZPu6HR46dCV-HaL4PQRTfEAeJCVXp6QSD7puqj_LYIkw6ra0_0RkWt4reuXJAvKZ07fMmBMNWPESOVTDlTOV2mlajiJM46WDaWgoG4&amp;sz=w632-h836&amp;ats=1445364468848&amp;rm=15086589a54013d7&amp;zw&amp;atsh=1\" alt=\"Inline image 2\" width=\"241\" height=\"320\" style=\"outline:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Can someone please tell me how to modify the above function (I have tried) or what options I should use with knitr::kable() to get those additional horizontal lines.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Thank you!</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Patrick </div></div>"
